{%- comment -%}
  "Results" testimonial cards (copy of the goda.co block): a cream box with a thin outline, a wide picture on top, a big percentage that COUNTS UP with a short line next to it, a thin divider, the customer's quote in italics, "Name | Verified Customer", and little dash-shaped dots underneath. The next card peeks in at the right edge, so people can see there is more to swipe.
  The percentage counts up exactly like the original script: the first card counts once when the page loads, every number counts again when the cards are half on screen, and the new card counts every time a card slides in. The row loops round forever (swipe past the last card and you are back at the first).
  No slider app and no slider library, just the browser's own scrolling, so it loads fast. Pictures load only when they get near the screen.
  Everything is sized from the width of the box, so it looks the same as goda's at any width (the text only stops shrinking when it would get too small to read on a phone).
  WHERE: Online Store > Themes > Customize > Product page > Add block (or Add section) > Custom Liquid, drag it where you want it (for example under your accordions in the product column), paste this in. The box fills the width it is given, up to mb_max_w.
  EDIT YOUR CONTENT BELOW. Do not use a straight apostrophe (') in the text, use &#39; instead, and write & as &amp;
  !!! THE THREE CARDS BELOW (REVIEWS, PERCENTAGES AND PICTURES) ARE THE ORIGINAL ONES FROM goda.co. THEY ARE ONLY HERE SO YOU CAN SEE THE SECTION WORKING. Do NOT publish another brand's customers, reviews or results on your own store. Replace every card with REAL reviews from YOUR customers (with their permission), upload your own pictures in Shopify admin > Content > Files, and only use percentages that come from your own real customer survey or testing.
  mb_cards = the cards, separated by @@ , and each card written as   PICTURE LINK ||| NUMBER ||| LINE NEXT TO THE NUMBER ||| THE QUOTE ||| NAME
  Example of one card:   https://yourstore.com/file.jpg ||| 91 ||| Said their skin felt softer ||| &ldquo;Love it!&rdquo; ||| Anna K.     (write 91 for 91%; leave the NUMBER empty to show no percentage; add as many cards as you like).
  mb_verified = the words after the name (for example Verified Customer). Leave empty to show only the name.
  mb_ratio = the shape of the card pictures as width / height. 413 / 180 is goda's wide shape. Other examples: 1 / 1 = square, 4 / 5 = a little taller. Write auto to show every picture at its own natural shape, uncropped.
  mb_img_pos = which part of the picture stays visible when it is cropped (center, top, bottom, or for example 50% 30%).
  mb_scale = make the whole box bigger or smaller: 1 is the same size as goda's, 1.1 = 10% bigger, 0.9 = 10% smaller.
  mb_pad_top = the space inside the box above the picture (goda's is about 10px, 22px gives it more room). mb_top (further down) is a different thing: the space ABOVE the whole box, outside it.
  mb_peek = true shows a little of the next card at the right edge (like goda). false shows one card at a time with nothing next to it.
  mb_max_w = the widest the box gets (use none to always fill the space it sits in).
  mb_color_text = the line next to the number, the quote and the name. mb_color_num = the big percentage. mb_color_check = the little tick next to the name. mb_color_accent = the active dot. mb_color_dot = the other dots. mb_card_bg / mb_card_border = the box colour / its outline. mb_img_border = the thin outline round the picture. mb_color_divider = the thin line under the number.
  mb_top / mb_bottom = space above and below the block.
{%- endcomment -%}
